{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Preserve TenantId when starting root executions**\n\nThe proxy discards the initial Invoke request's `X-Amz-Tenant-Id`. The runner supports `TenantId` and uses it when invoking the root handler, so tenant-aware roots otherwise receive no tenant context and execute unscoped. Pass the header through `start_execution`, conditionally add `TenantId` to `start_input`, and cover this path in the proxy tests.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPsIIsM75OsMr","finding_digest":"32eda7586a0d081f57d6e7e9e807ce4e9c079b7bf97e58fa334bb5a880a7dc54","finding_id":"arf_v1_glw2owdkbueb6v6w47u6qb6oj2","finding_key":"github/scripts/js_examples/invoke_proxy.py::start_execution::tenant-id-propagation","identity_key":"github/scripts/js_examples/invoke_proxy.py::start_execution::tenant-id-propagation","line":134,"observation_digest":"4aa01e9d27785345e3a4ab07ec9787bacc429be5e1439e2f7e30de67ce4a3096","observation_id":"aro_v1_jkqb5hjhpbjuly5evmd6zf4hxl","path":".github/scripts/js_examples/invoke_proxy.py","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-05T06:49:14Z","review_id":"arr_v1_42pxjmgykimp27isxjurdot2s5","reviewed_base_sha":"631b78d1b505b157eee758662291fc5e2353bbb6","reviewed_head_sha":"ca059e59caba02cf5eb95f8a71ce6a65e951487a","reviewer":"codex","start_line":134,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":745},"record_id":"art_v1_oi6bwl3skpqtpblgwdmuyn64re","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-05T06:49:14Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python","id":1052903600},"schema_version":1}
